</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With unique battle challenges, a wide cast of characters, each with a story to tell, and an ever present mystery looming over all the students' heads, can you crack the case before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/f8b7f90d6a5874e85779bf25eb302081.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/aca345f01c80d602e655dff8c49b97de.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/40bc53fe59aa52f23275c98577eeec0e.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/8f636d50e37a0544bc6828e44c197c7c.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/4df945acc711f4ecdb9e414ae501ad7e.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/ceb8f8249631dd8f7f9ee6c77156d27b.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517070/extras/0d3699e22a11f11a63cdfab101f3d21d.avif?t=1753190595\" width=616 h