unravel the mysteries that you come across.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the culprit</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze the evidence you find to identify the suspects from the cast of characters you meet, each with unique backgrounds and potential motives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put everything on the line to protect the studnets of the school by engaging in unique challenges against the sinister entities lurking in the shadows once you have forced them into the light.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices Matter</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices influence the story, leading to different consequences that will affect you in the game and even leading you to one of the different endings. Your choices will even shape Beni's relationships with other characters, particularly with her partner, Nadeshiko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
